*.log
npm-debug.log*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local-only working trees — kept on disk, never committed.
# The `/`-anchored entries are anchored deliberately: an unanchored entry also matches nested
# directories — an unanchored `docs/` once silently swallowed new fixtures under
# `src/test/fixtures/docs/` (already-tracked files were unaffected, so the breakage only
# showed up on a fresh clone).
process
/import-statement-design/
/qa/
/launch/
# Agent session state.
.claude/

# Local media — masters and cards that never enter the tree
images/*.mov
images/icon-original.png
images/social-preview.png

# Tooling artifacts
.playwright-mcp/
# ExTester screenshots/artifacts if a stale in-repo storage dir ever reappears. The real storage
# (downloaded VS Code/ChromeDriver, isolated profile, staged UI workspace, failure screenshots)
# lives at /tmp/auto-import-extester — a short path, because an in-repo storage dir pushes the
# Extension Host's unix-socket path past macOS's ~104-char limit (see .vscode-test.mjs).
.extester/
